 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Round trip",
   "texto": [
    "**ходил/ходила/ходили** (on foot) and **ездил/ездила/ездили** (on vehicle) usually count on a visit or a round trip. They may also express repeated or usual movements.",
    "**Вчера я ходил в кино** = yesterday I went to the movies. **Летом мы ездили в Москву** = In summer we went to Moscow.",
    "As in the past, the form matches the subject: **ходил/ездил** (masculine singular), **ходила/ездила** (feminine singular), **ходили/ездили** (plural)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Two verbs for each action",
   "texto": [
    "Many verbs form pairs of appearance, but the prefix is not always enough to predict the meaning. The **imperfectivo** focuses the process, a regular or repeated action; the **perfectivo** has a delimited fact or result.",
    "The reading is as complete as possible. The context decides the natural translation."
   ]
  },
